00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:15.230
Due to the Bloody Valentine tragedy, these tensions suddenly escalated into a full-scale war.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:43.550
It seemed a foregone conclusion that the Earth forces, with its superior numbers, would be victorious.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:47.220
But these initial assessments proved to be false.

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:52.950
Almost 11 months have passed since the conflict began, with no end in sight.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:36.330
